From 3a835f4a4105269fd97edad05dc9d313e215eed1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:06:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] kded: add an option to remove the mount point while a vault
 is locked

The empty mount point folder stayed around while a vault was locked, so
it cluttered the file manager. A new per-vault option removes it when the
vault gets locked and creates it again when the vault is unlocked.

BUG: 442854
